#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations.rst:16
msgid ""
"Data Distribution Service (DDS) implementations provide middleware options "
"for ROS communication, allowing you to select a vendor that suits your "
"platform and deployment needs. This article lists the supported DDS vendors "
"and links to setup guidance for using each implementation with ROS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations.rst:27
msgid "These are the available DDS implementations:"
msgstr ""

